WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.613
"This stinks," Eddy said.

2
00:00:09.614 --> 00:00:13.380
"I don't have a talent!"

3
00:00:13.381 --> 00:00:16.798
"Don't be silly," Poppy said.

4
00:00:16.799 --> 00:00:19.578
"Think, Eddy," Dipper said.

5
00:00:19.579 --> 00:00:30.123
"What do you love to do?"

6
00:00:30.124 --> 00:00:36.485
"I like to go fast," Eddy said.

7
00:00:36.486 --> 00:00:40.178
Just then Zippy drove over.

8
00:00:40.179 --> 00:00:45.507
Zippy laughed. "You're slow."

9
00:00:45.508 --> 00:00:50.182
"Going fast is not your talent!"

10
00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:52.896
Zippy sped off.

11
00:00:52.897 --> 00:01:02.791
"Grr!" Eddy zoomed after Zippy.

12
00:01:02.792 --> 00:01:09.591
They raced around the parking lot.

13
00:01:09.592 --> 00:01:14.800
Then they zoomed back.

14
00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:16.894
Eddy skidded.

15
00:01:16.895 --> 00:01:21.916
"Oh no!" Dipper cried.

16
00:01:21.917 --> 00:01:30.745
Crash! Eddy banged into Dipper.

17
00:01:30.746 --> 00:01:35.219
"Oof!" Dipper cried.

18
00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:37.864
"Sorry!" Eddy said.

19
00:01:37.865 --> 00:01:48.222
"Are you okay?"

20
00:01:48.223 --> 00:01:52.516
"I think so," Dipper said.

21
00:01:52.517 --> 00:01:55.506
She tried to play her music.

22
00:01:55.507 --> 00:01:58.940
But no sound came out.

23
00:01:58.941 --> 00:02:04.695
Dipper gulped.

24
00:02:04.696 --> 00:02:09.015
"My music player broke!"

